* LDO interno do DOIT DevKit V1 (AMS1117-3.3): 3.3V, dropout tipico ~1.1V @0.8A
* Modelo comportamental: Vout = min(3.3, Vin - (0.55 + 0.7*Iout))  [Vdo em volts, Iout em A]
* Corrente de entrada = corrente de saida (Fq) + quiescencia ~5mA (Rq 1k);
* caps internos tipicos 22u+100n na saida.
.subckt LDO_DEVKIT IN GND OUT
Vsense OUT_S OUT 0
Breg OUT_S GND V = min(3.3, V(IN,GND) - (0.55 + 0.7*abs(I(Vsense))))
Fq IN GND Vsense 1
Rq IN GND 1k
C1 IN GND 10u
C2 OUT_S GND 22u
C3 OUT_S GND 100n
.ends LDO_DEVKIT
